      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "Bhindi do pyaza is okra cooked twice with onion. Dry heat drives off the sliminess. Do not cover the pan at any point during cooking."}]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {"level": 2},
